@AGENTS.md

- Keep `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` in sync; apply the same change to both in one commit.
- Monorepo: bun workspaces + Turborepo. Apps in `apps/*`, shared packages in `packages/*`, all named `@yc/*`.
- Run tasks from the repo root (`bun run lint`, `bun run test`, `bun run build`); narrow with `--filter=@yc/site` or `--filter=@yc/cms`.
- Primary branch: `develop`. Use conventional commit messages.
- Package manager: bun (`bun.lock`). Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
